22:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Check the route before investing in the scholarship file",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Check the route before investing in the scholarship file"}],[["$","p","The university’s scholarship criteria cover tuition-paying applicants from outside the EU/EEA and Switzerland, mainly master’s degrees, with named bachelor’s exceptions. The Lund programme concerned must be first choice in the national application. Check the full current conditions, including special arts arrangements, rather than assuming every English-taught course qualifies.",{"children":"The university’s scholarship criteria cover tuition-paying applicants from outside the EU/EEA and Switzerland, mainly master’s degrees, with named bachelor’s exceptions. The Lund programme concerned must be first choice in the national application. Check the full current conditions, including special arts arrangements, rather than assuming every English-taught course qualifies."}],["$","p","Use an original route check with two fictional students. Student A wants a master’s and has identified a course with suitable academic prerequisites. Student B wants a bachelor’s that is absent from the scholarship’s exception list. They should not follow the same funding assumption simply because both study pages are in English. Student B needs another verified funding route or a different affordable plan.",{"children":"Use an original route check with two fictional students. Student A wants a master’s and has identified a course with suitable academic prerequisites. Student B wants a bachelor’s that is absent from the scholarship’s exception list. They should not follow the same funding assumption simply because both study pages are in English. Student B needs another verified funding route or a different affordable plan."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L25",null,{"id":"scholarships/lund-university-global-scholarship:section-2","title":"Check your progress","items":["The exact degree and route fit the scholarship’s current scope.","My prior qualification meets the programme’s entry requirements.","The selected Lund programme is my genuine first preference.","I have a workable plan for costs outside tuition."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.lunduniversity.lu.se/study/admission-degree-studies/scholarships-and-awards/lund-university-global-scholarship",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.lunduniversity.lu.se/study/admission-degree-studies/scholarships-and-awards/lund-university-global-scholarship","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Lund: Global Scholarship conditions and status"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-A two-portal dependency checklist",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"A two-portal dependency checklist"}],[["$","p","Lund requires a complete national programme application and payment of the application fee before the separate scholarship application. The two portals are not substitutes. Use Lund’s application-steps guidance to organise the programme selection, documentation and fee tasks, then follow the scholarship form when its new round opens.",{"children":"Lund requires a complete national programme application and payment of the application fee before the separate scholarship application. The two portals are not substitutes. Use Lund’s application-steps guidance to organise the programme selection, documentation and fee tasks, then follow the scholarship form when its new round opens."}],"$L26","$L27"],"$undefined","$L28","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L29","$undefined"]}],"$L2a","$L2b","$L2c"]}]
23:["$","section",null,{"className":"source-section","aria-labelledby":"official-sources","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"official-sources","children":"Official sources and verification"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Source records support the guide. Page update dates describe editorial changes; they do not mean every linked rule was checked again today. Reopen the current call for your programme and intake."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"source-grid","children":[["$","$L5","https://www.lunduniversity.lu.se/study/admission-degree-studies/scholarships-and-awards/lund-university-global-scholarship",{"href":"https://www.lunduniversity.lu.se/study/admission-degree-studies/scholarships-and-awards/lund-university-global-scholarship","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Lund: Global Scholarship conditions and status"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"At retrieval scholarship applications remain closed, last stated deadline 16 February 2026. Generic February pattern is not a verified 2027 scholarship window."}]]}],["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M15 3h6v6","key":"1q9fwt"}],["path",{"d":"M10 14 21 3","key":"gplh6r"}],["path",{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6","key":"a6xqqp"}]],"className":"lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","https://www.lunduniversity.lu.se/study/admission-degree-studies/applying-studies-when-apply",{"href":"https://www.lunduniversity.lu.se/study/admission-degree-studies/applying-studies-when-apply","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Lund: when to apply for degree studies"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Primary source reviewed 16 November 2026 (Los Angeles; retrieved 17 November UTC). Reopen the exact programme or call before acting."}]]}],["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$23:props:children:2:props:children:0:props