26:["$","p","Create a record with a separate status for each dependency. In a fictional file, the student has ranked the course and paid the fee, but a required transcript page is missing. “Fee paid” does not mean the academic application is complete. Fix the document task through the official process; do not enter a scholarship deadline as a replacement document deadline.",{"children":"Create a record with a separate status for each dependency. In a fictional file, the student has ranked the course and paid the fee, but a required transcript page is missing. “Fee paid” does not mean the academic application is complete. Fix the document task through the official process; do not enter a scholarship deadline as a replacement document deadline."}]
27:["$","p","Keep programme and scholarship confirmation numbers in distinct fields, with links to the relevant messages. Use consistent identity details across the records. Before marking a task complete, read the final status in the actual system instead of relying on a local filename such as “final application”. A saved draft should stay labelled draft.",{"children":"Keep programme and scholarship confirmation numbers in distinct fields, with links to the relevant messages. Use consistent identity details across the records. Before marking a task complete, read the final status in the actual system instead of relying on a local filename such as “final application”. A saved draft should stay labelled draft."}]
